This plugin contains work derived from a third-party project.

The following skills are modified forks of skills from the Superpowers project
(https://github.com/obra/superpowers):

  - skills/writing-plans/
  - skills/executing-plans/
  - skills/subagent-driven-development/

They have been modified from their original form (principally: sequential
task-by-task execution was replaced with dependency-wave dispatch, plus
orchestration tags, write-set discipline, and an autonomous-run blocker
protocol). The unmodified fork-point copies are kept under .upstream-base/ for
reference and rebasing; see MAINTAINERS.md.

